----------------------------------------------------------------------------
This MIT license covers rfox's own source code:
  - the `rfox` entry script
  - the `rflib/rfox/` package and its subcommand modules
  - rfox documentation (RFTOOL.md, etc.)

rfox builds on top a python3 fork of rfcat (https://github.com/aqu-crypt/rfcat),
which is distributed under its own BSD-style license. See `LICENSE` in this 
repository for the rfcat license terms. The CC-Bootloader is covered separately 
by `LICENSE.CC-Bootloader`.
